B.MK=s(["Research the live company and contact.","Prepare three priority discovery questions and one relevant artifact.","Define the next step you want if the conversation is a fit."],t.s)
B.FJ=new A.dN(12,"Discovery Preparation","Prepare for serious conversations without over-rehearsing.","Discovery","Company research, three priority questions, one useful artifact, and a next-step plan.","Preparation helps uncover the business problem without pretending to know what has not been verified.",B.la,"worksheets/Module-12-Discovery-Preparation-Worksheet.pdf",B.LF,B.MK)
