B.Lg=s(["A first engagement should reduce risk for both sides by being small, bounded, and explicit.","Separate process metrics you control from sales outcomes you cannot guarantee.","Write responsibilities, payment, timing, and review conditions before work starts."],t.s)
B.MS=s(["Define pilot scope, duration, and deliverables.","Choose measurable process or funnel metrics and client responsibilities.","Write the proposal, compensation terms, and review point."],t.s)
B.FP=new A.dN(13,"Paid-Pilot Conversion","Make the first engagement small, clear, measurable, and paid.","Conversion","A bounded pilot with scope, metrics, responsibilities, compensation, and proposal.","Terms are explicit, risk is controlled, and no outcome outside the learner's control is guaranteed.",B.IY,"worksheets/Module-13-Paid-Pilot-Conversion-Worksheet.pdf",B.Lg,B.MS)
